# V4.60: Live TV subtitles - overlay subtitle layer on the browser player: /live/subs.vtt endpoint extracts the channel Teletext subtitle stream with ffmpeg and converts it to WebVTT, JS polls it every ~20s and renders cues on a yellow subtitle overlay synced to the video, toggle button (الترجمة: تشغيل/إيقاف). DVB bitmap subtitles are NOT converted (ffmpeg cannot OCR them) - those still need VLC. If ffmpeg is missing or the channel has no Teletext subtitles, the player shows a clear status note instead of failing.
# V4.59: Panel UI redesign - ALL buttons Gradient (danger red->orange, middle steel-blue->slate, bottom charcoal->black, Tuner rose->pink, Live TV pink->purple, Virtual Remote blended violet->magenta on top), Live TV label English-only, whole Panel UI font Century Gothic, Panel banner small+simple (U-Panel + thin gradient line + box status).
# V4.58: Live TV (مشاهدة مباشرة) in Panel UI - /live page: video player (mpegts.js) streaming current channel via port 8001, light transcode toggle 8002, zap from channel list, now/next EPG, /live/m3u for VLC.
# V4.57: Panel UI is now installable as a PWA: manifest + app icon (U on Remote two-tone) + standalone fullscreen meta tags. Add to Home Screen from the phone browser to open it like an app (no browser bar). Icon/manifest served without login; still LAN-only, no offline.
