# V4.53: Panel is now GLOSSY (no left-right gradient): solid deep base color + strong white gloss highlight on top half, brighter top edge, deeper shadow. Icons smaller (22px) in circular glossy bubble chips. Tuner Signal Reader icon is now a satellite dish.
