# V4.49: All Panel UI buttons are now GRADIENT (green / red / teal / violet) - no more flat colors anywhere, Panel and all pages.
# V4.48: Panel is now TWO COLUMNS (Virtual Remote spans the full width on top, all other buttons in pairs). Buttons are smaller inside the grid so two fit on a phone screen.
# V4.47: Panel - Flash Image button removed (was a duplicate of Download / Flash Image), replaced by Tuner Signal Reader. New /signal page: Tuner Setting (tuner/satellite/frequency/SR/polarization/FEC) + live gradient signal (SNR/AGC/Quality/BER), auto-refresh every 3 sec, Tune zaps the receiver to a channel on that transponder.
# V4.46: Panel reorder (Remote first green, Restart Enigma 2nd, Reboot 3rd, Scheduled Backup red, Download/Flash Image red after it), blue -> teal, Plugin Install by external command, /images shows HDD subfolder zips + flash after download + real multiboot slots from /boot/STARTUP*.
# V4.45: Removed the Tip paragraph under the Virtual Remote (Diagnosis + Back to Panel buttons kept).
